{"nodes": [{"id": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_native_irc", "label": "Native IRC catalog (LMDB-backed SqlCatalog)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "IRC-forward: keep the standard REST surface (any IRC client can point at it) while implementation stays native; LMDB holds only catalog transactions, base tables stay Parquet + metadata.json on filesystem."}, {"id": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_lmdb_store", "label": "LmdbCatalogStore (CatalogStore over liblmdb)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "LMDB single-writer/multi-reader MVCC fits RunInTransaction; UpdateTableMetadataLocation is a head-pointer CAS. Tradeoff: drops JdbcCatalog SQL-DB interop, kept acceptable for purely-local research; CatalogStore seam keeps SQLite available later."}, {"id": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_ppcatalogd", "label": "pp-catalogd native IRC server (cpp-httplib)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Thin JSON<->Catalog adapter: reuses iceberg-cpp's exported internal serde for both directions so no hand-written serializers; metadata engine (apply updates, write metadata.json, CAS) lives in SqlCatalog not the HTTP layer."}, {"id": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_commit_ordering", "label": "Commit ordering \u2014 LMDB CAS last, single-writer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Parquet->manifests->metadata.json written to filesystem first, then the LMDB pointer CAS last = the publish. Under single-writer a CAS->0 signals a bug/lock bypass, not a race, so no retry loops. Two-table atomicity handled by committing partitions before primes."}, {"id": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_commitfiles", "label": "CommitFiles seam (create-or-load + FastAppend)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "DRY refactor of PublishTable fed by a single {schema, spec} provider so the writer's partition spec and CreateTable's cannot drift; retires the dead files.jsonl text bridge."}, {"id": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_sqlite_migration", "label": "Raw-SQLite reader migration onto the catalog seam", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "source_scan.cc, preflight.cc, ui_iceberg.cc each read iceberg_tables via raw sqlite3_open; moving to LMDB strands them unless they resolve metadata through LoadTable, so consolidate into iceberg_util.h."}], "edges": [{"source": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_native_irc", "target": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_lmdb_store", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_native_irc", "target": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_ppcatalogd", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_ppcatalogd", "target": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_lmdb_store", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_commit_ordering", "target": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_lmdb_store", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_commitfiles", "target": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_commit_ordering", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_sqlite_migration", "target": "native_src_source_scan", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_sqlite_migration", "target": "native_src_ui_iceberg", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_lmdb_store", "target": "native_src_catalog_pp_lmdb_store", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_ppcatalogd", "target": "native_src_catalog_pp_catalogd", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "iceberg_catalog_write_path", "label": "Iceberg native write/commit path (warehouse, LMDB catalog, CommitFiles, generate)", "nodes": ["markdown_data_eng_iceberg_data_setup_warehouse", "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_native_irc", "markdown_data_eng_irc_catalog_design_commitfiles", "native_readme_generate"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "markdown/data_eng/irc_catalog_design.md"}]}